P6-T5 reverse-canary probe document.

Its extension `.dbl` is claimed by NO builtin server (patches/omo-dsh/vendor/
lsp-core/src/lsp/server-definitions.ts:54-160 owns no `.dbl`), so the only row
that can answer a tool call against this file is the scenario's own user-config
row — the one whose command names a binary that cannot exist
(`lsp-double-not-installed-binary`). The call therefore has exactly one honest
way to come back: the engine's NAMED missing-dependency result.

This file is a document, not code. It is never executed.
